  "card": "Reject unrecognized keys in the options dictionary of the sendall RPC rather than silently ignoring them, and remove the unused solving_data option. Callers making typos in option names currently face unintended wallet behavior, such as spending all wallet UTXOs if inputs is misspelled, or broadcasting an unintended transaction if psbt or add_to_wallet is mistyped. The change aligns sendall with existing strict option parsing in RPCs like send, fundrawtransaction, and bumpfee.",
